# Terraform
**/.terraform/*
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
crash.log
*.tfvars
!terraform/terraform.tfvars
backend.conf

# Generated at deploy time by deploy-custodian.yml
policies/accounts.yml

# SSH keys
*.pem

# Archives
*.zip

# Helm dependency tarball from `helm dependency update` (Chart.lock pins the digest)
gitops/platform/monitoring/charts/

# Node.js
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*

# Environment variables
.env
.env.*


# Markdown files
*.md
*.mdc
!README.md
!docs/**/*.md

# Java / Python build artifacts (vendored BoA src)
**/target/
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
*.class
